```

The application header controls navigation between these interfaces.

---

# Public Scoreboard

The scoreboard is intended for participants and spectators.

It displays:

- Teams
- Scores
- Rankings
- Team members
- Medal indicators
- Registration countdown
- Registration QR code

The scoreboard should remain visually clear when displayed on a large TV during a live event.

---

# Team Ranking

Teams are displayed according to score.

The highest-scoring teams appear first.

The leading teams receive visual ranking indicators.

The top three positions use:

- Gold
- Silver
- Bronze

This provides immediate visual feedback during a competition.

