# Admin Dashboard

The Admin Dashboard provides event-management functionality.

Its responsibilities currently include:

- Event settings
- Team management
- Score management
- Score history
- Modal workflows

The dashboard layout has been redesigned to avoid presenting every administrative feature as an equally sized panel.

Important information is grouped according to function and priority.

