The frontend should continue using accessible HTML patterns.

Existing examples include:

- Button elements for actions
- Dialog roles
- Alert-dialog roles for destructive confirmation
- ARIA labels where the visible button text lacks sufficient context
- Keyboard focus indicators

Accessibility should be reviewed alongside responsive behaviour as components evolve.

