# Backend Integration Impact

Several current frontend handlers will eventually change.

Operations such as:

```text
handleAddTeam
handleUpdateTeam
handleConfirmDeleteTeam
handleScoreChange
handleResetAllScores
handleDeadlineChange
```

currently manipulate React state.

After integration, they will communicate with Spring Boot.

For example:

```text
Current

handleAddTeam
    |
    v
setTeams()


Future

handleAddTeam
    |
    v
POST /api/teams
    |
    v
Spring Boot
    |
    v
PostgreSQL
    |
    v
React receives updated data
```

This is why backend development is the next major phase.

---

# Current Frontend Status

The frontend has reached the point where the primary event-management workflows exist.

Continuing to add large amounts of temporary frontend-only persistence would create code that must later be replaced.

The next major development phase is therefore the Spring Boot backend.
